      { question: 'Are cameras vandal-resistant in parking garages?', answer: 'We use IK10 impact-rated cast aluminum dome cameras built specifically to withstand vandalism and harsh environments.' },
      { question: 'Do you offer 24/7 technical support for commercial clients?', answer: 'Yes, Fort Worth Security Cameras provides priority emergency support and local technician dispatch.' }
